        "text": "Psychology has an impact on market prices and cycles, and the psychological market cycles are well known, but they're not always easy to read. From the Dutch tulip mania in the 1600s to the dot com bubble in the 90s, even skilled traders have struggled to separate their own emotions from the overall market sentiment. Investors face the difficult task of understanding not only the market's psychology, but also their own psychology and how that is affecting their decision making process. Congratulations. You've completed Binance Academy's course on trading basics. Remember to check out Binance Academy's website and follow us on YouTube, Facebook and Twitter to stay tuned for future courses. See you in Binance Academy's next course.",
